{"id": "bart-on-call-project-allocations", "title": "Two consultants spread BART labor charges across projects", "seconds": 42.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "a795ec352145517d", "words": 123, "beats": [{"scene": "bench", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "BART put eight firms on call with contract ceilings of 40 million dollars each.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.29, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "project", "got", "the", "bill?"], "sub": "BART on-call work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.47, 0.72, 1.07, 1.22, 1.52, 1.71, 2.2, 2.63, 2.76, 3.07, 3.37, 3.69]}, {"scene": "bench", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Those ceilings tell us how much BART could authorize. They do not measure actual spending.", "t0": 4.41, "t1": 9.27, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bench", "kicker": "Bay Area Rapid Transit", "text": "Board agreements", "mark": "Board agreements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.72, 0.94, 1.07, 1.22, 1.45, 1.74, 1.94, 3.02, 3.22, 3.35, 3.56, 3.96, 4.39]}, {"scene": "bench", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Inspector General found two firms divided their bills among projects using percentages.", "t0": 9.39, "t1": 14.57, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Labor across projects"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.75, 1.16, 1.5, 1.81, 2.35, 2.8, 2.96, 3.27, 3.57, 4.09, 4.4]}, {"scene": "bench", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One closed project picked up 2,869 dollars in charges.", "t0": 14.69, "t1": 18.74, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Project accounting", "heading": "Two different problems", "source": "allocation", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Project completed in 2022", "value": "$2,869"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Nine invoices", "value": "$5,580"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.59, 1.04, 1.31, 1.44, 1.64, 2.03, 2.23, 2.5, 3.01, 3.38, 3.5]}, {"scene": "bench", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Nine invoices totaling 5,580 dollars lacked matching support.", "t0": 18.86, "t1": 23.55, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,580", "label": "Nine invoices without matching support"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.91, 1.39, 1.65, 2.08, 2.32, 2.6, 2.83, 3.2, 3.53, 3.92]}, {"scene": "bench", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Six had no documentation. Three had documents for a different line.", "t0": 23.67, "t1": 27.84, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "allocation", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Missing records", "mark": "Missing records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.55, 0.7, 2.25, 2.6, 2.77, 3.25, 3.4, 3.47, 3.79]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["defense[0]"], "text": "Management confirmed the firm did work on other projects.", "t0": 28.06, "t1": 30.73, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Services on other projects"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.88, 1.0, 1.27, 1.46, 1.68, 1.78, 1.99]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["defense[0]"], "text": "BART declined to pursue relief under the False Claims Act.", "t0": 30.85, "t1": 33.78, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "allocation", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Management response", "mark": "Management response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.75, 0.86, 1.22, 1.59, 1.81, 1.92, 2.22, 2.6]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not say whether the two amounts overlap or how much moved across all contracts.", "t0": 33.9, "t1": 39.46, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Total misallocated", "Overlap between the amounts"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.61, 0.8, 1.01, 1.29, 1.41, 1.65, 2.09, 3.2